OL,3,GNEWSATeen attacked people and stole
OL,4,Acars at tram stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "callous" and "violent" teenager who
OL,7,Frepeatedly attacked people at a tram
OL,8,Fstation as he stole their cars and
OL,9,Fphones has been jailed.
OL,11,FDuring his first attack Tyrone Downing,
OL,12,Fdressed in a balaclava, punched a woman
OL,13,Fin the face as she tried to escape
OL,14,Fafter he demanded her car keys on 26
OL,15,FJuly 2024, at Wednesbury Parkway
OL,16,Fstation.
OL,18,FHe later slashed a man's arm with a
OL,19,Fknife in order to steal his iPhone,
OL,20,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said. He
OL,21,Falso stole a car from a woman who he
OL,22,Fattacked as she was pushing her baby.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
