OL,3,GNEWSATeen attacked people and stole
OL,4,Acars at tram stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowning,19 and from Wednesbury, was
OL,7,Fsentenced at Wolverhampton Crown Court
OL,8,Fon 27 August to four years in prison
OL,9,Fafter admitting robbery and stealing
OL,10,Fcars, among other offences.
